  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Pham",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Pham.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Therese Pham (MED0002331952) completed her medical degree at Western Sydney University. She worked for a number of years across multiple hospitals across Sydney before commencing a career in General Practice. She has a particular interest in skin cancer surgical procedures, women's health and paediatrics and holds a Graduate Certificate in Child Health.",
      "In her spare time, she enjoys pilates and reading."
    ]
